size 100 10
start
keys <Tab> j x <CR>
keys o
keys <CR>
frame a-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
A +work
B +home
-- a-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  1   A                                                                      +work │
│>+work    1/1││                                                                                   │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│                                                                                   │
│             ││                                                                                   │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  x done  t state  o new  a append  dd delete  u undo  / search  ? help
-- a-file --
A +work
B +home
